OL,3,GNEWSAMigrants rescued in Dutch waters
OL,4,Aas 1600 reach UK coast
OL,5,
OL,6,FThirty-eight migrants have been rescued
OL,7,Fafter a small boat was found drifting
OL,8,Foff the Dutch coast, authorities say.
OL,10,FIt comes as Home Office figures show
OL,11,Fmore than 1,600 people have landed in
OL,12,Fthe UK in four days after crossing the
OL,13,FChannel.
OL,15,FThis year there have been launches from
OL,16,Fa wider stretch of coast from Belgium
OL,17,Fto Normandy in France, usually bound
OL,18,Ffor Kent.
OL,20,FThe government said that overall
OL,21,Fcrossings were down significantly this
OL,22,Fyear.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
